  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">HIV/AIDS - Prevenindo a Transmiss&#xe3;o Vertical.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HIV/AIDS - Preventing Mother-to-Child Transmission</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HIV/AIDS - Prevent mother-to-child HIV transmission (PMTCT) including counseling and testing for pregnant women, ARV prophylaxis for HIV-infected pregnant women and newborns, counseling and support for maternal nutrition and safe infant feeding practices. PMTCT-plus ARV-treatment activities should be coded under Sub-Element 1.1.10 (HIV/AIDS Treatment and Anti-Retroviral Drugs) and Sub-Element 1.1.11 (HIV/AIDS Treatment and Anti-Retroviral Services).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">VIH/SIDA - Prevenir a transmiss&#xe3;o do VIH de m&#xe3;e para filho (PTV), incluindo aconselhamento e testes para mulheres gr&#xe1;vidas, profilaxia ARV para mulheres gr&#xe1;vidas e rec&#xe9;m-nascidos infectados pelo VIH, aconselhamento e apoio &#xe0; nutri&#xe7;&#xe3;o materna e pr&#xe1;ticas seguras de alimenta&#xe7;&#xe3;o infantil. As actividades de PTV mais tratamento ARV devem ser codificadas no Subelemento 1.1.10 (Tratamento do VIH/SIDA e Medicamentos Anti-Retrovirais) e no Subelemento 1.1.11 (Tratamento do VIH/SIDA e Servi&#xe7;os Anti-Retrovirais).</narrative>
  </description>
